The following events are received by the unauthenticated WebSocket:

| Event | Leaked Data |
|-------|-------------|
| `savedoc` | Document root ID, operation data |
| `transactions` | Document title, ID, attrs (new/old) |
| `create` | Document path, notebook info (name, ID) |
